# Offline demo sealed side (synthetic answers/canaries + raw mock outputs): reproducible with one command, not committed.
examples/*/sealed-demo/
# The null-world demo is reproducible; keep only its report and summary in git.
examples/demo-null-disjoint/*
!examples/demo-null-disjoint/REPORT.md
!examples/demo-null-disjoint/summary.json
# Never in the repository (see sealed/README.md).
sealed/*
!sealed/README.md
results/
registration.local.json
KILL
